    {
      "id": "lNRaSmkjreP33gsG3VFT2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 645.6165565345121,
      "y": 976.0078686971291,
      "width": 700.2999267578125,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 863900658,
      "version": 1112,
      "versionNonce": 695489778,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775995411117,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1、AI Agent审计功能增强\nAutoDream多种分层压缩记忆，支持静默执行，提升高风险交易的准确性\n\n2、安全加固\n支持云端访问加解密机制，审计日志沙盒存储\n\n3、特性增加\n多端IM接口，对标小龙虾，能远端控制，当前已经mcp化可以直接做插件来适配\n增强AI远端意图识别准确度\n多模态提醒，图片和音频展示接入\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1、AI Agent审计功能增强\nAutoDream多种分层压缩记忆，支持静默执行，提升高风险交易的准确性\n\n2、安全加固\n支持云端访问加解密机制，审计日志沙盒存储\n\n3、特性增加\n多端IM接口，对标小龙虾，能远端控制，当前已经mcp化可以直接做插件来适配\n增强AI远端意图识别准确度\n多模态提醒，图片和音频展示接入\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8G1DPl985czfhjaW8wddL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1495.4324775330947,
      "y": 199.54593109324279,
      "width": 749.8999633789062,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 390286254,
      "version": 355,
      "versionNonce": 627171250,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1775995193519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1、（可行动）Agent可自行意图判断（百毫秒级别）自行交易，无AI可人工打断介入\n2、（不失控）Agent远端SOP化，两级安全加固\n3、支付可审核，可追溯\n4、去中心化，安全（如下展开）\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1、（可行动）Agent可自行意图判断（百毫秒级别）自行交易，无AI可人工打断介入\n2、（不失控）Agent远端SOP化，两级安全加固\n3、支付可审核，可追溯\n4、去中心化，安全（如下展开）\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
